        "buildJavaScript": "Follow these rules when generating code:\n- Update the existing useAttack function so it accepts parameters the student planned in prompt.md.\n- Update the four button event listeners so each one calls useAttack with the correct arguments for that attack.\n- Do not add loops, arrays, or conditional logic.\n- Keep the code structure and style consistent with what already exists in the file.\n- Do not modify any HTML or CSS.\n- Do not add new functions beyond updating useAttack."
