    "bubble_choice_description": "Use AI to build a function that updates the battle when an attack is selected. Test different inputs and see how the move and damage change.",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nThe Battle Simulator lets a player choose an attack and see what move was used and how much damage was dealt. Right now, the function that updates the battle ignores which attack was clicked. Use AI to add parameters so the displays show the correct move and damage.\r\n\r\nPlan in `spec.md`, then prompt the AI with your plan to generate the function. Test by clicking different attacks.",
